  <p>
    Which colors make up this photo? And how do I find matching tones for a website, logo or presentation? The Kodini Color Extractor answers both questions in one tool: part 1 reads the dominant colors of an image, part 2 creates harmonious color palettes from them or from scratch. Everything runs in the browser, with no registration and no upload.
  </p>

